  "place": "dungeon flooded_cistern set B: floor 1 mini-boss (24 m pump room)",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). A lamp-spirit that lit the cistern for the workers and went wrong in the dark. It is fast and fragile and hard to pin: it teleports between three WALL LAMPS (it can only blink to a lit one). Light gives it power — snuff the lamps by using them (they count as \"lit\" when you put them OUT; once all three are dark, it is stranded and exposed). P1: sparks, a flare cone, a lantern-beam line. P2 at 50%: it splits into wisps (adds) behind a glow ward that drops when they die.",
  "party": "Solo: fine (the lamps are the fight). 2-3: one snuffs while the others hit. 5: the snuffing is over in seconds; M5 should add a fourth lamp per 2 extra players and raise health x1.5.",
  "hpMult": 2,
  "arena": {
    "radius": 12,
    "objects": [
      {
        "id": "lamp_a",
        "type": "brazier",
        "name": "Wall lamp (use to snuff)",
        "x": -8,
        "z": -4
      },
      {
        "id": "lamp_b",
        "type": "brazier",
        "name": "Wall lamp (use to snuff)",
        "x": 8,
        "z": -4
      },
      {
        "id": "lamp_c",
        "type": "brazier",
        "name": "Wall lamp (use to snuff)",
        "x": 0,
        "z": 8
      }
    ]
